  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of Ethiopian Civil Society Organizations&apos; capacities in Transitional Justice Monitoring, Advocacy, Public Awareness, and Strategic Litigation at National and Regional Levels in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to lay a strong foundation for CSOs and survivor networks to generate evidence, critically monitor the TJ process, prepare to engage in strategic litigation; and to support and push for a survivor-centered TJ process that ensures truth-seeking, accountability, reparations, guarantees of non-recurrence, reconciliation, and healing in Ethiopia.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
